 "annotations": [
  "agent summary: The COD balance does not close: measured methane plus effluent COD exceed the feed COD the log and catalogue declare (mean closure -0.142, 2 windows inadmissible; call 3). The kinetic fit (call 10) moved Y_ac to 1.27 but left gas flow, VS and TAN biased from day 0 to the end (bias_z 8.45, 14.9 and -6.1; calls 12-14), so the fitted values are compensation and are not offered as the plant's parameters. An independent VS assay agrees with the routine VS record (disagreement_z 4.1 against the model; call 15), so the most likely cause is influent composition (more COD/solids and relatively less N than declared); the prediction is the default-kinetics simulation (call 4), and no claim is made about the high-load windows where pH is informatively missing.",
